  "analysis_md": "原式\n$$\n=\\int_0^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}d\\varphi\\int_0^{2\\cos\\varphi}r^2\\sin^2\\varphi\\cdot r^2\\sin\\varphi\\,dr=\\frac{64\\pi}{5}\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\sin^3\\varphi\\cdot\\cos^5\\varphi\\,d\\varphi\n$$\n$$\n=\\frac{64\\pi}{5}\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}(\\cos^7\\varphi-\\cos^5\\varphi)\\,d\\cos\\varphi=\\frac{64\\pi}{5}\\cdot\\left.\\left(\\frac{\\cos^8\\varphi}{8}-\\frac{\\cos^6\\varphi}{6}\\right)\\right|_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}=\\frac{8\\pi}{15}.\n$$",
